{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0584_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "92ff39f9ac10f70d7aba9527f9f899fb8df85089d1204e5d4b36d01422b588be", "ja": "まさに！姫は厳しくチェックしていたのです。\n王様の衣装なので、隅々まで細か～く、厳し～く……。", "zh": "没错！公主刚才一直在严格检查呢。\n毕竟是国王的服装，所以从头到尾都要仔仔细细、严严格格地检查……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0584_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "47148e37bd80ebe3a681db86451909e13ea39222171ca4a01c9071d793f969b4", "ja": "でも、どう考えても、とってもしっく！で、\nえれがんと！な王様になれそうなのです♪", "zh": "不过怎么看，都觉得会成为一位超时髦！又优雅！的国王呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0584_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2eef5deec0bc9f7fad2d64f723e56377e701ef75805664c6bb4e02bc67c065b7", "ja": "それは良かった。クールで威厳のある姿で、\nまつりの新たな魅力も感じてもらえそうだな。", "zh": "那就好。以这副冷酷而威严的姿态，应该也能让大家感受到小祭新的魅力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0584_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "62a0bbd6551cfdce38df7974be202ac04ea63357bb634534da55980b688754d2", "ja": "ほ？　それはつまり、きゅーと！な姫の、\nくーる！な魅力、ということなのです？", "zh": "哦？也就是说，这是可爱公主的、帅气魅力吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0584_1011_p", "source_sha256": "de13e60400066221675bc2bbe77c1bff3726ead5b9b240e062a3014cf1352bdf", "ja": "ああ、凛々しくて強そうな女王陛下、って感じだ！", "zh": "啊，就是那种英姿飒爽、看起来很强的女王陛下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0584_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "def07afe973df5fb68be187a568836006f6907ec456072d2f7bb51511e8c38dd", "ja": "強そうな、女王陛下…………。\nなんだか、響きが可愛くないのです。", "zh": "看起来很强的，女王陛下…………。\n总觉得，听起来一点都不可爱呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0584_1013_p", "source_sha256": "2ebe79f939bc86dabf672f5d11007d37460a48556c1626ec6a807ae59cd045bf", "ja": "えっ！　そ、そうか……？", "zh": "诶！这、这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
