{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0584_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "103f9b54af899b5bc8183518d724b572a6caddf25b31d1440ec0b8645e55f23c", "ja": "しょんぼりなのです……しおしおなのです……\n顔を洗って出直してくるのです……。", "zh": "好沮丧哦……蔫巴巴的……\n我去洗把脸再回来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0584_1016_p", "source_sha256": "0b2e09116a14fbb5204500fb60c51d9a41d2bfd8bd9a2287daba2792ec8850fe", "ja": "待ってくれ！　褒めたつもりだったんだけどな……。\nもちろんまつりは可愛いままだぞ。可愛くて凛々しい！", "zh": "等等！我本来是在夸你啊……\n茉莉当然依然很可爱啦。又可爱又帅气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
