{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0584_1020_p", "source_sha256": "bd3e3b093dbb203b31e30f19dcedb48c3979653b51c140defcb4ec9eba0a3594", "ja": "おかしくないです。\n……ん？　スイーツ？", "zh": "没什么奇怪的。\n……嗯？甜点？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0584_1021_021mat", "source_sha256": "589b3896b46e3c135865ef7f69c3dcd9a720057d1be4ceb29b221201beb59811", "ja": "そういえば、すっかりおやつの時間なのです……。\nそれはさておき、姫はまだ自信が持てないのです……。", "zh": "说起来，已经完全是点心时间了呢……\n先不说这个，公主还没有自信……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0584_1022_p", "source_sha256": "adef5b843ba57faf8c1315e34ce29fb2249c7376b0e50a81032bda38133c1d0d", "ja": "な、なるほど……。よし、よくわかった。確認用に、\n今すぐとびきりのスイーツを買ってくるよ！", "zh": "啊、原来如此……好，我明白了。为了确认一下，我现在就去买最棒的甜点回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
